"831\"><strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"844\">Functies:</strong> Streaming, spraakbediening, casting<br data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\"><strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"895\">Voeding:</strong> USB / adapter<br data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"912\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"922\">Kleur:</strong> Wit<br data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"929\"><strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"939\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1051\">📦 <strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"976\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"979\">Google Chromecast HD<br data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1002\">Afstandsbediening<br data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1022\">Voedingsadapter<br data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1040\">USB-kabel</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1110\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1075\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1078\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"contents\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
